.Sh HISTORY
The
.Sy X509_V_FLAG_NO_ALT_CHAINS
flag was added in OpenSSL 1.1.0. The flag
.Sy X509_V_FLAG_CB_ISSUER_CHECK
was deprecated in OpenSSL 1.1.0 and has no effect.
.Pp
The
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_get_hostflags
function was added in OpenSSL 1.1.0i.
.Pp
The
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_get0_host ,
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_get0_email ,
and
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_get1_ip_asc
functions were added in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The function
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_add0_policy
was historically documented as enabling policy checking however the
implementation has never done this.
The documentation was changed to align with the implementation.
.Pp
The
.Fn X509_VERIFY_PARAM_get_purpose
function was added in OpenSSL 3.5.
